<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-16T09:59:47.990Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:59:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed a traditional ruler in Plateau and soldiers were feared killed in a Boko Haram and ISWAP attack on a Borno military post. Bandits abducted a Kaduna couple and their six-month-old daughter, later releasing them after a N300 million ransom demand. The insurgency continues to target local officials and civilians, with Islamist fighters striking army bases and bandit groups conducting kidnappings. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOcVF3RUtRN2k0NG40WkFWUUQ1eFFuWEJZenZzM0lLWFRNNFNZWHZEdGg4MTZfQV9DZUtwSjQ1dE9LSzE2SjQ3V3F4RkdqQUpleHNtRGM1S216ZW9HYnJxSDJuUnJWRFF6SHliQWRqM0t0eTZaRVMwdzVsaG5RTzZuLVg1Q0l4a2FxN1FRUEVvUlJOeVFZS3JreGl1Z1hBZ1BxbjJCc3p6VnZSZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPVnVPblZndFJBSDRmTUhhZFlKYmxoc2FnQnFEN3RKcUxFUS1yd3pSaHN6ejJJYW0xN3ZGQUFMdUpZWmItdHdGYTdOZzhxVXFNU2VJNUs1eVBBaVgtYXVLd1JxbzdWUzdOZmszcTJYS3N3X1ExN0dIZWc4OHUzOHZWQXBMb1Y?oc=5&quot;&gt;NigerianEye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNZmV4Rnc3NU9RVEV1QVFtajR4dFl3VG1McGdjMUlhUGdONjVzTjl2ZHFfRlFET3FIZ1lRS0tJUXlEMnVpU2c3VnBSSVhsby1qbERrZ0lmenhpbW5EVHd3SzZKb0xnWFYtQ0tmR0hEbUJSWnpTQzJXTUNxakpTTlgwa2ZMcGRfUWVjLVZOaWdhOXprX1lqZXV6M2p3X2lWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;crimefightersng.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/